entries.matn_en:
Sa'd b. 'Ubada got up to urinate and then came back and said: 'I feel something in my back.'" It was not long before he died. The jinn lamented him, saying (meter: sari'):

"We killed the chief of the Khazraj, Sa'd b. 'Ubada;
We shot him with two arrows, and did not miss his heart."
